<p>A GET request made to this URI uses HTTP Content Negotiation. However, if you explicitly wish to retrieve a particular serialisation, you can also do so using the following URLs:</p>

<dl>
<% OUTPUT_FORMATS.each do |_, extension, name| %>
  <dt><%= ERB::Util.h(File.basename(basename)) %><%= extension %></dt>
  <dd><%= name %></dd>
<% end %>
</dl>
